WEBVTT

24:02.009 --> 24:04.428
I want you to promise me,

24:04.553 --> 24:06.221
no more climbing.

24:11.059 --> 24:12.227
I promise.

24:14.396 --> 24:17.441
- Do you know what?
- What?

24:17.566 --> 24:19.776
You always look at your feet
before you lie.

24:19.901 --> 24:21.820
(CHUCKLES)

24:21.945 --> 24:23.697
Run and find your father.

24:23.822 --> 24:25.866
Tell him the king is close.
